  "description": "The MuleSoft MCP server provides governed access to your entire IT landscape - APIs, Agents, MCPs & LLMs - to accelerate production ready AI, at scale. \n\nKey features:\n\nScan - Automatically surface services across AWS Bedrock, Kong, Apigee, Google Vertex, and more, without manual cataloging.\n\nDiscover - Search and browse APIs, agents, MCP servers, and LLMs in one place.\n\nGovern - Apply and enforce policies across your full landscape, including PII detection, semantic routing, and token controls, for the infrastructure you already run.\n\nMonitor - Track traffic, cost, and performance across every service in a consolidated view.\n\nThe MuleSoft MCP server helps you scan, discover, govern, and manage your entire API, Agent, MCP, and LLM ecosystem.",
